OL,3,GNEWSACouncil given #1m from government
OL,4,Afor youth hubs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city council has received funding to
OL,7,Fdevelop two youth hubs for 10 to
OL,8,F18-year-olds as part of a government
OL,9,Finitiative to strengthen youth services
OL,10,Facross England.
OL,12,FPeterborough City Council has been
OL,13,Fallocated up to #1m by the Department
OL,14,Ffor Culture, Media and Sport (DCMS) to
OL,15,Festablish Young Futures Hubs, subject
OL,16,Fto approval of an implementation plan
OL,17,Fexpected in March 2027.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
