OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil given #1m from government
OL,4,Afor youth hubs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hubs will bring together a range of
OL,7,Fservices under one roof, including
OL,8,Fmental health support, skills and
OL,9,Ftraining opportunities and crime
OL,10,Fprevention programmes.
OL,12,FAndrew Pakes, the Labour MP for
OL,13,FPeterborough, said the funding was
OL,14,F"fantastic" for young people in the
OL,15,Fcity.
